  <div class="mobile" id="mobile">
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
    <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
    <a href="#compare">Compare</a>
    <a href="#visit">Visit</a>
    <a href="#contact">Book a consultation</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge gold">★ 5.0 · 2 Google reviews</span>
      <span class="badge">Women-owned</span>
      <span class="badge" id="heroStatus">Checking hours…</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Growth you can actually manage.</h1>
    <p>Advance Business Group is a business management consulting firm in Brooklyn Park, Minnesota. We help owner-led companies handle rapid growth without losing profitability — through clear strategy, tighter processes, and better people decisions.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a conversation →</a>
      <a href="tel:+16122818869" class="btn btn-ghost">📞 (612) 281-8869</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS -->
<section class="stats">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="5.0" data-dec="1">0</b><span>Google rating</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="100">0</b><span>% 5-star reviews</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="4">0</b><span>Core practice areas</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>MN</b><span>Twin Cities based</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
    <h2>Four ways we help you move forward</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px">Every engagement starts with the same question: what's actually holding this business back? Pick a practice area to see how we work.</p>

    <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
      <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tab="0">Strategic Planning</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="1">Process &amp; Operations</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="2">Leadership Coaching</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="3">Talent &amp; Team Building</button>
    </div>

    <div class="panel show" data-panel="0">
      <div>
        <h3>Strategic Planning &amp; Vision</h3>
        <p>Most companies don't fail from a lack of ideas — they stall because nobody has agreed on which idea comes first. We facilitate the sessions that turn scattered priorities into a plan your leadership team will actually follow.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Facilitated strategic planning retreats and offsites</li>
          <li>Vision, mission and multi-year roadmap development</li>
          <li>Goal-setting frameworks with owners and measurable milestones</li>
          <li>Quarterly review cadence to keep the plan alive</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <aside class="panel-aside">
        <h4>From a client review</h4>
        <p>"…envisioning the future for each of those aspects."</p>
        <p style="font-style:normal;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--slate-light);margin-top:12px">— Donna G., Google review</p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" data-panel="1">
      <div>
        <h3>Process Improvement &amp; Operations</h3>
        <p>Growth exposes every weak seam in how work gets done. We map what's really happening, find the bottleneck, and rebuild the workflow so margin doesn't disappear as revenue climbs.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Current-state process mapping and bottleneck analysis</li>
          <li>Profitability review — where growth is quietly costing you</li>
          <li>Standard operating procedures and handoff design</li>
          <li>Scorecards and KPIs that leadership actually reviews</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <aside class="panel-aside">
        <h4>From a client review</h4>
        <p>"…struggling with how to manage rapid growth while maintaining profitability, improving processes, flushing out and solving issues…"</p>
        <p style="font-style:normal;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--slate-light);margin-top:12px">— Donna G., Google review</p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" data-panel="2">
      <div>
        <h3>Executive Coaching &amp; Facilitation</h3>
